Subject: [PATCH RFC] media: meson: port completion ordering and Meson8b VDEC1 formats

Keep DOS syscon and genpd/runtime PM. Transfer the runtime IRQ completion,
async capture conversion and EOS ownership fixes. Add the existing vendor
MPEG-1/2, MPEG-4, VC-1 advanced and MJPEG VDEC1 paths to the research
platform. Known codec tail/content limits remain. HEVC needs separate
power-domain plumbing and is not advertised. Compile checks are not board
acceptance.

---
